==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{ety|ru|:af|по-|крыть}}
From {{af|ru|по-|крыть}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|покры́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-покрыть.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|ɨtʲ|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|покры́ть|pf|impf=крыть,покрыва́ть}}

# to [[cover]], to [[roof]] (''a house'') ; to [[thatch]], to [[tile]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''покры́ть''' [[шифер|ши́фером]]|t=to [[slate]]}}
# to [[coat]] (''with paint'')
# to [[cover]], to [[trump]] (''in card games'')
#: {{ux|ru|ему́ не́чем '''крыть'''|t=he hasn't a leg to stand on, there's nothing he can say to that (''original meaning: he has no (good) card to cover'' (''colloquial'')}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[scold]], to [[rail]] (at), to [[swear]] (at)

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|12a+p|покры́ть|покро́}}

